/-!
# The exact-endomorphism classes on `Fin 3`

`Definability/ExactEnd3.lean` turns term-structurality into `End(M') = End(M)`, so each of the
`156` endomorphism monoids realised on `Fin 3` is a rectangle of non-term-structurality facts: the
laws with a model whose endomorphism monoid is *exactly* that one are not term-structural over the
laws with none.
`24` of the classes buy open cells, one module each; `endprune3.py` picks them and cuts each
rectangle to the laws worth listing.

Everything here is generated by `genend3.py`. `Definability/Certs/End3*.lean` record the
rectangles.
-/
